// Ch12 B13 "Down the other side" (E, 1 min, no dialogue). Day 3, the north descent under the last pass-cord.
// Ullari-fashion, NOBODY LOOKS BACK; the camera is a forward-only rail. If Rhen tied a knot, his hand goes up
// to the cord as he passes under it and he doesn't look. Toma glances back once at the line, at Kerrid
// (last), then faces forward.
title: ch12_down_the_other_side
location: ch12/keth_pass
---
@camera P08
@music keth_pass fade=2.0
@mark toma descent_1 walk
@mark pell descent_2 walk
@mark asha descent_3 walk
@mark ysolde descent_4 walk
@mark liss descent_5 walk
@mark rhen descent_6 walk
@mark kerrid descent_7 walk
<<if $ch12_rhen_tied_knot>>
    @anim rhen touch pass_cord
<<endif>>
@wait 3.0
@anim toma look_at kerrid
@wait 1.0
@anim toma look_at road_ahead
@wait 3.0
<<set $ch12_complete = true>>
@camera release
===
